WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From a seated position, stack the right knee over the left, drawing both feet toward opposite hips.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Sit tall on the sit bones, evening out the weight across the pelvis.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Reach the right arm up, bend the elbow, and let the hand fall between the shoulder blades.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Sweep the left arm behind the low back and clasp the hands (or a strap).

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Lift the chest, breathe into the shoulders, then release and switch sides.
